00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:17,680
And you need a lot of free amino acids.

00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:23,680
The only way you're going to get that free amino acid content is to eat enough protein.

00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:30,680
And most of the time cancer patients are already insufficient to their diet as far as how much they can eat.

00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,680
