00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:45,680
You know, eat what they should be eating.

00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:48,680
And they're very often deficient in protein.

00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:57,680
In fact, that's one amino side that a person can have cancer is low blood protein levels.

00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:07,680
So when you have a total protein or albumin levels and globular levels that are deficient, that is an amino side for possible cancer in itself.

00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:14,680
So you need to consume enough protein in you could say, well, we can do that through our vegetables.

00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,680
We can do that through this.

00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:24,680
Well, maybe a healthy person can eat enough that but you really need to consume your weight, your desired weight.

00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:35,680
So if you've already lost weight from cancer and you're below your desired weight, let's say your desired weight is 150 and you're at 135, you need to eat 150 grams of protein per day.

00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,680
That's a lot of grams of protein per day.

00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:42,680
Now, you can get that in if you eat too several pieces of chicken with your other diet.

