00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:51,680
It's just very difficult to get that you need adequate amounts of protein to do that.

00:03:51,680 --> 00:04:00,680
Plus protein, this way in red meat can help with red blood cell formation, which anemia is another major issue with cancer patients.

